{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane 空间"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Eilenberg--MacLane空间"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对正整数 $n$ 与群 $G$ (当 $n&gt;1$ 时要求为 Abel 群), Eilenberg–MacLane 空间 $K(G,n)$ 是同伦等价意义下唯一以 $G$ 为 $n$ 阶"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦群","text":"同伦群"}},{"Plain":"的 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":" $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"空间.</p>\n<p>在一般的 $\\infty$-意象中, Eilenberg–MacLane 对象是指<strong>带点</strong> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":" $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"对象. 注意这里带点条件很重要. 不带点的 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":" $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"对象称为 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"束","text":"束"}},{"Plain":" (gerbe).</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>Eilenberg–MacLane 空间 $K(G,n)$ 是 $G$ (作为离散"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-群","text":"Abel 群"}},{"Plain":") 的 $n$ 阶"},{"Local":{"url":"逆环路空间","text":"逆环路空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>一维 CW 复形</h3>\n<p>一维 CW 复形是 $K(G,1)$, 其中 $G$ 为其基本群.</p>\n<h3>射影空间</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbb{R}P^\\infty$ 是 $K(\\mathbb{Z}_2,1)$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathbb{C}P^\\infty$ 是 $K(\\mathbb{Z},2)$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}